# No environment variables are needed to run the frontend any more.
#
# The soundboard calls /api on its own origin: in production the Go binary serves both
# the site and the API, and in dev Vite proxies /api to localhost:8080 (see
# vite.config.ts). There is no API URL to configure in either case.
#
# This file is kept as a placeholder so the pattern is obvious if a real public variable
# is ever needed.
